# Cloudflare Pages headers — Boss Demo V1 preview.
#
# X-Robots-Tag is the transport-level counterpart to the meta robots tag. It
# still applies to responses a crawler fetches directly (assets, a URL reached
# without reading robots.txt first), which the HTML meta tag cannot cover.
#
# AT GO-LIVE: remove the X-Robots-Tag block below together with the
# public/robots.txt change and VITE_ALLOW_INDEXING=true. See
# docs/LAUNCH_CHECKLIST.md.

/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
